          "title": "TP 3 — OPENLDAP",
          "badge": "Linux",
          "duration": "1h",
          "level": "Intermédiaire",
          "tool": "PROXMOX / SSH",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Installation de LDAP ainsi que de Ubuntu server sur un environnement virtuel ( PROXMOX )"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "content": "sudo apt install apache2 php php-cgi libapache2-mod-php php-mbstring php-common php-pear -y\n\t\nsudo apt install slapd ldap-utils -y\n\nsudo slapcat\n\nsudo apt -y install ldap-account-manager\n\nsudo a2enconf php*-cgi\n\nsudo systemctl restart apache2\n\nsudo systemctl enable apache2\n\nsudo systemctl status apache2\n\nsudo ufw status\n\nsudo ufw enable \n\nsudo ufw allow 80\n\nsudo ufw allow 443\n\nsudo ufw allow 389",
              "lang": "BASH"
            },
            {
              "type": "step",
              "content": "Nous mettons en place dès le début le renouvellement des paquets UBUNTU ",
              "stepTitle": "Maintien à jour des paquets "
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "content": "sudo apt update & sudo apt upgrade\n",
              "lang": "Bash"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "nous allons voir verifier puis mettre un HOSTNAME "
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "content": "hostname\n\nhostnamectl set-hostname ldap.NOM.local",
              "lang": "Bash"
            },
            {
              "type": "step",
              "content": "",
              "stepTitle": "Ajout de l'ip au hostname "
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "content": "sudo nano /etc/hosts\n \n# X.X.X.X ldap.HOSTNAME.local",
              "lang": "bash"
            },
            {
              "type": "step",
